    "description": "## Objective\n\nDedicated integration user + connected app for the backend to upsert Study Link Clicks and Players, with least-privilege access and auditable record changes.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Connected app with OAuth per design doc story A-04\n* Assign WT_Integration permissions only\n* Document endpoint, auth flow, and upsert contract for the backend team\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* Backend can authenticate and upsert a Study Link Click in sandbox using only the integration user's rights\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nAPI upsert test suite (Postman or script).\n\n## Open Questions\n\n* Confirm whether the org's included integration-user licenses cover this user (client checking with their Salesforce AE).\n\n---\n\nEstimate: M · \\~12h · Dependencies: BUILD-01 · Ticket BUILD-02 (approved 2026-07-04)",
